A cursed unicorn horn will do in a pinch, *if* you also
have a blessed one, but the recommended method is a
forgotten low-level spell.  The game contains numerous
spells at level 1 or 2 that are usually not useful enough,
past the middle of the game or so, that you need to bother
to read the book again and refresh them.

Low-level spells that are mainly useful in the early game
include protection, slow monster, cure blindness, sleep,
knock, and (arguably) force bolt.

Low-level spells that are really only useful if you want to
train up the skill (so you can cast more useful mid-level
spells in the same school) include detect monsters, detect
food, and confuse monster.

Also, the spell of healing is really only useful if you
can't cast extra healing.

Learn any one of those spells, don't read
the book again, and once you forget it you
can use it for the rest of the game for easy
on-demand confusion.  HTH.HAND.


